within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.C_CardiovascularSystem.C08C_SelectiveCalciumChannelBlockersWithMainlyVascula.C08CA05_Nifedipine;
model Nifedipine_Kiriyama2024_PD_qt
  "sigmoid_emax exposure-response sweep — Kiriyama_2024 :: QT (QT interval)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep(
    E0 = 0.0758,      // [s; msec × 0.001]
    Emax = 0.0763,  // [s; msec × 0.001]
    EC50 = 0.003227,  // [kg/m3; ng/mL × 1e-06]
    gamma = 0.857,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng/mL per second
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 33000, Interval = 66),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Nifedipine_Kiriyama2024_PD_qt</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Kiriyama A et al., <i>Pharmacology research &amp; perspectives 12(4):e1249</i> 2024 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/prp2.1249\">doi:10.1002/prp2.1249</a>) — QT interval [msec] against nifedipine ng/mL — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: sigmoid_emax.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =       75.8 msec     drug-free response (baseline) (E0, Q324)
  Emax  =       76.3 msec     maximal effect term (Emax, Q320)
  EC50  =       3227 ng/mL    exposure at half of the maximal effect term (EC50, Q321)
  gamma =      0.857          Hill coefficient (γ, Q325)</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep\">SigmoidEmaxSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng/mL of nifedipine per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 0.0758   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (3227 ng/mL)  response 0.1139
  exposure -> infinity  response 0.1521</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Kiriyama_2024: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Nifedipine_Kiriyama2024_PD_qt;
